# syntek-base only — this file is copier-excluded, so a generated project never receives it.
#
# Everything the `teach` skill writes here is throwaway practice by definition — the folder's own
# CONTEXT.md says so. Practice written while developing the TEMPLATE is a test of the sandbox
# rather than a lesson anyone else needs, so it stays on this machine.
#
# A generated project's lessons are committed and synced across <%DEVELOPER_NAME%>'s devices,
# which is what learning/CONTEXT.md describes. That is why this rule must not travel.
#
# The documentation pair stays tracked so the folder ships documented and ready to use.
*

# This file must stay tracked or the rule vanishes on a fresh clone, and copier.yml
# can only exclude a file the template actually carries.
!.gitignore
!*/
!CONTEXT.md
!CLAUDE.md
